OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloudy with
OL,6,Foutbreaks of heavy rain spreading east
OL,7,Fthrough the evening. Further outbreaks
OL,8,Fof heavy rain overnight, perhaps
OL,9,Fthundery for a time, then turning more
OL,10,Fshowery towards morning.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTuesday:FFrequent showers feed in from
OL,13,Fthe northwest through the day, heavy
OL,14,Fand thundery at times. Best of any
OL,15,Fbrighter spells in the east.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
