OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:
OL,6,FShowers Wednesday morning, becoming
OL,7,Fdry and bright by midday. A band of
OL,8,Fheavy rain pushes east Wednesday
OL,9,Fevening. Frequent heavy showers on
OL,10,FThursday, easing Friday morning, then
OL,11,Ffurther rain later.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
